      "created_at": "2025-11-14T12:24:24.055Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Context: I have properly configured BOM with proper ratios for a finished product. I plan to maintain \"Must be Whole Number”, because in my use case it doesn’t make sense to have the raw materials as decimal numbers.</p>\n<p>Finish Product: 2 pc of “AB”</p>\n<p>Raw Materials: 3 pcs of “A” and 5 pcs of “B”</p>\n<p>Problem: When I create Work Orders, I want the minimum manufactured quantity to be either the Quantity mentioned in the BOM (“2”) or multiples of 2 so that the raw materials does not turn into a decimal and lead to errors.</p>\n<p>What is the forum’s suggestion on this matter?</p>\n<p>Thank you</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/0/1/0100e2f314186acf881271ca4de508b61fd1badb.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/0100e2f314186acf881271ca4de508b61fd1badb\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/1/0100e2f314186acf881271ca4de508b61fd1badb_2_690x356.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"8Snmy8ukbxHvvwKndhJNXkwok3\" width=\"690\" height=\"356\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/1/0100e2f314186acf881271ca4de508b61fd1badb_2_690x356.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/1/0100e2f314186acf881271ca4de508b61fd1badb_2_1035x534.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/1/0100e2f314186acf881271ca4de508b61fd1badb_2_1380x712.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FAF9F9\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1600×827 47.3 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
