      "created_at": "2025-11-15T22:12:20.200Z",
      "cooked": "<p><a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/luigi_torres\">@Luigi_Torres</a></p>\n<p>You can set the precision of Required Qty field to Zero by <strong>customizing child table</strong>.</p>\n<p>Precision can also be set globally by setting <strong>System Setting</strong>.</p>\n<p>The UOM itself can control Qty either it can be recorded as a <strong>Whole Number</strong> or not.</p>",
